          <a href="#motor-question" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. The Motor Question: Peak Horsepower, Brushless Claims and One Teardown</a>
          <a href="#weight-capacity" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">5. Reading the 320 lb Capacity Claim Sensibly</a>
          <a href="#noise" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">6. Noise: The Under-40 dB Claim</a>
          <a href="#apps-and-controls" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">7. Controls, Apps and What They Cost</a>
          <a href="#warranty-and-service" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">8. Warranty, Returns and Seller Service</a>
